{
  "videoId": "media:632c5fb846d126b5bf339c2375b04856",
  "url": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20Would%20It%20Take%20To%20Say%20We%20Found%20Life%3F%20-%20Tori%20Hoehler/What%20Would%20It%20Take%20To%20Say%20We%20Found%20Life%3F%20-%20Tori%20Hoehler~mobile.mp4",
  "title": "What Would It Take To Say We Found Life? We Asked a NASA Expert",
  "language": "en",
  "origin": "creator-captions",
  "producer": "publisher-subtitles",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20Would%20It%20Take%20To%20Say%20We%20Found%20Life%3F%20-%20Tori%20Hoehler/What%20Would%20It%20Take%20To%20Say%20We%20Found%20Life%3F%20-%20Tori%20Hoehler.srt",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startSec": 0.445,
      "endSec": 3.111,
      "text": "What Would It Take to Say We Found Life?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 3.911,
      "endSec": 6.511,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 6.633,
      "endSec": 8.6,
      "text": "We call this the podium test."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 8.6,
      "endSec": 9.267,
      "text": "What would it take"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 9.267,
      "endSec": 9.667,
      "text": "for you"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 9.667,
      "endSec": 11.467,
      "text": "personally to confidently stand up"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 11.467,
      "endSec": 13.067,
      "text": "in front of an international audience"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 13.067,
      "endSec": 14.434,
      "text": "and make that claim?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 14.434,
      "endSec": 15.734,
      "text": "When you put it in that way,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 15.734,
      "endSec": 17.367,
      "text": "I think for a lot of scientists,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 17.367,
      "endSec": 19.134,
      "text": "the bar is really high."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 19.134,
      "endSec": 19.667,
      "text": "So of course,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 19.667,
      "endSec": 20.834,
      "text": "there would be obvious things,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 20.834,
      "endSec": 21.734,
      "text": "you know, a very clear"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 21.734,
      "endSec": 22.967,
      "text": "signature of technology"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 22.967,
      "endSec": 25.267,
      "text": "or a skeleton or something like that."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 25.267,
      "endSec": 26.668,
      "text": "But we think that a lot of the evidence"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 26.668,
      "endSec": 27.601,
      "text": "that we might encounter"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 27.601,
      "endSec": 29.101,
      "text": "first will be much more subtle."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 29.101,
      "endSec": 30.934,
      "text": "For example, chemical signs of life"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 30.934,
      "endSec": 31.934,
      "text": "that have to be"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 31.934,
      "endSec": 33.435,
      "text": "detected above a background"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 33.435,
      "endSec": 35.401,
      "text": "of abiotic chemistry."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 35.401,
      "endSec": 36.468,
      "text": "And really, what we see"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 36.468,
      "endSec": 38.601,
      "text": "might depend a lot on where we look."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 38.601,
      "endSec": 40.302,
      "text": "On Mars, for example,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 40.302,
      "endSec": 41.835,
      "text": "the long history of exploration"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 41.835,
      "endSec": 43.335,
      "text": "there gives us a lot of context"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 43.335,
      "endSec": 44.768,
      "text": "for what we might find."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 44.768,
      "endSec": 45.435,
      "text": "But we're potentially"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 45.435,
      "endSec": 46.402,
      "text": "talking about samples"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 46.402,
      "endSec": 47.769,
      "text": "that are billions of years old"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 47.769,
      "endSec": 49.469,
      "text": "in those cases, and on Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 49.469,
      "endSec": 50.569,
      "text": "those kinds of samples,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 50.569,
      "endSec": 51.869,
      "text": "the evidence of life is often"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 51.869,
      "endSec": 54.136,
      "text": "degraded and difficult to detect."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 54.136,
      "endSec": 55.036,
      "text": "On the ocean worlds"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 55.036,
      "endSec": 56.169,
      "text": "of our outer solar system,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 56.169,
      "endSec": 59.102,
      "text": "so places like Jupiter's moon Europa"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 59.102,
      "endSec": 60.936,
      "text": "and Saturn's moon Enceladus,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 60.936,
      "endSec": 61.769,
      "text": "there's the tantalizing"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 61.769,
      "endSec": 63.369,
      "text": "possibility of extant life,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 63.369,
      "endSec": 65.169,
      "text": "meaning life that's still alive."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 65.169,
      "endSec": 66.503,
      "text": "But potentially we're talking about"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 66.503,
      "endSec": 68.37,
      "text": "exceedingly small amounts of samples"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 68.37,
      "endSec": 69.636,
      "text": "that would have to be analyzed"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 69.636,
      "endSec": 70.87,
      "text": "with a relatively limited"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 70.87,
      "endSec": 71.97,
      "text": "amount of instrumentation"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 71.97,
      "endSec": 73.17,
      "text": "that can be carried from Earth"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 73.17,
      "endSec": 74.903,
      "text": "billions of miles away."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 74.903,
      "endSec": 76.203,
      "text": "And then for exoplanets,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.203,
      "endSec": 76.903,
      "text": "these are planets"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.903,
      "endSec": 78.603,
      "text": "beyond our own solar system."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 78.603,
      "endSec": 79.803,
      "text": "Really, what we're looking for"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 79.803,
      "endSec": 81.67,
      "text": "there are very large magnitude"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 81.67,
      "endSec": 83.504,
      "text": "signs of life that can be detectable"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 83.504,
      "endSec": 84.67,
      "text": "through a telescope"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 84.67,
      "endSec": 86.104,
      "text": "from many light-years away."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 86.104,
      "endSec": 86.871,
      "text": "So changes"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 86.871,
      "endSec": 88.304,
      "text": "like the oxygenation"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 88.304,
      "endSec": 89.237,
      "text": "of Earth's atmosphere"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 89.237,
      "endSec": 91.271,
      "text": "or changes in surface color."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 91.271,
      "endSec": 92.571,
      "text": "So any one of those things,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 92.571,
      "endSec": 94.004,
      "text": "if they rose to the suspicion"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 94.004,
      "endSec": 95.971,
      "text": "of being evidence of life,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 95.971,
      "endSec": 97.838,
      "text": "would be really heavily scrutinized"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 97.838,
      "endSec": 100.238,
      "text": "in a very sort of specific and custom"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 100.238,
      "endSec": 102.405,
      "text": "way to that particular observation."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 102.405,
      "endSec": 103.338,
      "text": "But I think there are also"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 103.338,
      "endSec": 104.471,
      "text": "some general principles"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 104.471,
      "endSec": 105.205,
      "text": "that we can follow."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 105.205,
      "endSec": 106.772,
      "text": "And the first is just:"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 106.772,
      "endSec": 108.105,
      "text": "Are we sure we're seeing what we think"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 108.105,
      "endSec": 109.072,
      "text": "we're seeing?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 109.072,
      "endSec": 110.205,
      "text": "Many of these environments"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 110.205,
      "endSec": 111.672,
      "text": "are not very well known to us,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 111.672,
      "endSec": 113.305,
      "text": "and so we need to convince ourselves"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 113.305,
      "endSec": 114.972,
      "text": "that we're actually seeing a clear signal"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 114.972,
      "endSec": 116.039,
      "text": "that represents"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 116.039,
      "endSec": 117.605,
      "text": "what we think it represents."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 117.605,
      "endSec": 118.305,
      "text": "Carl Sagan"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 118.305,
      "endSec": 119.105,
      "text": "once said, “life"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 119.105,
      "endSec": 121.372,
      "text": "is the hypothesis of last resort,”"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 121.372,
      "endSec": 123.106,
      "text": "meaning that we ought to work hard"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 123.106,
      "endSec": 124.472,
      "text": "for such a claim to rule out"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 124.472,
      "endSec": 126.272,
      "text": "alternative possibilities."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 126.272,
      "endSec": 128.006,
      "text": "So what are those possibilities?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 128.006,
      "endSec": 129.839,
      "text": "One is contamination."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 129.839,
      "endSec": 131.339,
      "text": "The spacecraft and the instruments"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 131.339,
      "endSec": 131.906,
      "text": "that we use"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 131.906,
      "endSec": 132.373,
      "text": "to look for"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 132.373,
      "endSec": 133.173,
      "text": "evidence of life"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 133.173,
      "endSec": 135.106,
      "text": "are built in an environment, Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 135.106,
      "endSec": 136.173,
      "text": "that is full of life."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 136.173,
      "endSec": 137.706,
      "text": "And so we need to convince ourselves"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 137.706,
      "endSec": 138.973,
      "text": "that what we're seeing"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 138.973,
      "endSec": 140.473,
      "text": "is not evidence of our own life,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 140.473,
      "endSec": 142.673,
      "text": "but evidence of indigenous life."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 142.673,
      "endSec": 143.507,
      "text": "If that's the case,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 143.507,
      "endSec": 144.573,
      "text": "we should ask,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 144.573,
      "endSec": 145.74,
      "text": "should life of the type"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 145.74,
      "endSec": 147.907,
      "text": "we're seeing live there?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 147.907,
      "endSec": 148.807,
      "text": "And finally,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 148.807,
      "endSec": 149.707,
      "text": "we need to ask,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 149.707,
      "endSec": 151.107,
      "text": "is there any other way than life"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 151.107,
      "endSec": 152.074,
      "text": "to make that thing,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 152.074,
      "endSec": 153.407,
      "text": "any of the possible"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 153.407,
      "endSec": 155.407,
      "text": "abiotic processes that we know"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 155.407,
      "endSec": 157.007,
      "text": "and even the ones that we don't know?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 157.007,
      "endSec": 157.974,
      "text": "And as you can imagine,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 157.974,
      "endSec": 159.274,
      "text": "that will be quite a challenge."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 159.274,
      "endSec": 160.908,
      "text": "Once we have a piece of evidence"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 160.908,
      "endSec": 161.974,
      "text": "in hand that we really do"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 161.974,
      "endSec": 163.108,
      "text": "think represents"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 163.108,
      "endSec": 164.408,
      "text": "evidence of life,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 164.408,
      "endSec": 166.608,
      "text": "now we can begin to develop hypotheses."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 166.608,
      "endSec": 167.375,
      "text": "For example,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 167.375,
      "endSec": 168.875,
      "text": "do we have separate independent"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 168.875,
      "endSec": 170.741,
      "text": "lines of evidence that corroborate"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 170.741,
      "endSec": 171.741,
      "text": "what we've seen"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 171.741,
      "endSec": 174.342,
      "text": "and increase our confidence of life?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 174.342,
      "endSec": 175.008,
      "text": "Ultimately,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 175.008,
      "endSec": 176.742,
      "text": "all of this has to be looked at hard"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 176.742,
      "endSec": 178.442,
      "text": "by the entire scientific community,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 178.442,
      "endSec": 179.042,
      "text": "and in that sense,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 179.042,
      "endSec": 181.442,
      "text": "I think the really operative word in our question"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 181.442,
      "endSec": 182.475,
      "text": "is we."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 182.475,
      "endSec": 183.575,
      "text": "What does it take to say"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 183.575,
      "endSec": 185.142,
      "text": "we found evidence of life?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 185.142,
      "endSec": 186.375,
      "text": "Because really, the answer,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 186.375,
      "endSec": 187.576,
      "text": "I think, depends"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 187.576,
      "endSec": 188.609,
      "text": "on the full scientific"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 188.609,
      "endSec": 190.342,
      "text": "community scrutinizing"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 190.342,
      "endSec": 192.242,
      "text": "and skepticizing this observation"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 192.242,
      "endSec": 193.042,
      "text": "to finally say"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 193.042,
      "endSec": 196.043,
      "text": "that we scientists, we as a community"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 196.143,
      "endSec": 198.276,
      "text": "and we as humanity found life."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 199.098,
      "endSec": 202.623,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 203.089,
      "endSec": 207.3,
      "text": "NASA. A NASA 360 Production."
    }
  ]
}
